<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  Optional Maven user settings for maintainers (GPG signing, Sonatype credentials).

  Copy relevant sections into your Maven user settings file, or copy to settings.xml at the repository root and set MVN_SETTINGS for build scripts. Do not commit a populated settings.xml.

  See MAINTAINERS.md (release) and SECURITY.md.

